{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Before we dig in to the API, let's get you set up!"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install your TanStack Virtual adapter as a dependency using your favorite npm package manager"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"react-virtual","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Virtual"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/react-virtual","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"solid-virtual","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid Virtual"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/solid-virtual","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"svelte-virtual","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte Virtual"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/svelte-virtual","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"vue-virtual","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Vue Virtual"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/vue-virtual","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"lit-virtual","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lit Virtual"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/lit-virtual","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"angular-virtual","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular Virtual"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/angular-virtual","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"marko-virtual","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Marko Virtual"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/marko-virtual","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"virtual-core-no-framework","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Virtual Core (no framework)"}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm install @tanstack/virtual-core","lang":"bash"}],"headings":[{"id":"react-virtual","text":"React Virtual","level":2},{"id":"solid-virtual","text":"Solid Virtual","level":2},{"id":"svelte-virtual","text":"Svelte Virtual","level":2},{"id":"vue-virtual","text":"Vue Virtual","level":2},{"id":"lit-virtual","text":"Lit Virtual","level":2},{"id":"angular-virtual","text":"Angular Virtual","level":2},{"id":"marko-virtual","text":"Marko Virtual","level":2},{"id":"virtual-core-no-framework","text":"Virtual Core (no framework)","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nBefore we dig in to the API, let's get you set up!\n\nInstall your TanStack Virtual adapter as a dependency using your favorite npm package manager\n\n## React Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/react-virtual\n```\n\n## Solid Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/solid-virtual\n```\n\n## Svelte Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/svelte-virtual\n```\n\n## Vue Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/vue-virtual\n```\n\n## Lit Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/lit-virtual\n```\n\n## Angular Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/angular-virtual\n```\n\n## Marko Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/marko-virtual\n```\n\n## Virtual Core (no framework)\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/virtual-core\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Installation\n---\n\nBefore we dig in to the API, let's get you set up!\n\nInstall your TanStack Virtual adapter as a dependency using your favorite npm package manager\n\n## React Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/react-virtual\n```\n\n## Solid Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/solid-virtual\n```\n\n## Svelte Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/svelte-virtual\n```\n\n## Vue Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/vue-virtual\n```\n\n## Lit Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/lit-virtual\n```\n\n## Angular Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/angular-virtual\n```\n\n## Marko Virtual\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/marko-virtual\n```\n\n## Virtual Core (no framework)\n\n```bash\nnpm install @tanstack/virtual-core\n```\n"}
